# Platform: mobilesite
# Imported from Testsigma: RFQ - All Verification (test case 2183, run 115613, last result FAILURE)
# Tags: regression
# Live 02-Oct-2026: PRP "Get Best Price" now opens the B2B Assist AI chat (login first);
#   catalogue "Send Enquiry" still opens the old RFQ (question form, or the blue keyword page on a fresh session).
# No lead is submitted: steps that send an enquiry / OTP stay off.

call Live_Touch_Chrome_Navigate_to_Homepage_setup_Popup
# --- PRP Get Best Price -> B2B Assist chat (not logged in) ---
open https://www.justdial.com/jdmart/Mumbai/CCTV/jdm-1016209-ent-2-13630321?fl=undefined&ismap=undefined&subpage=&searchCase=&term=&searchLocUpdate=0&stype=category_list&srcterm=CCTV
wait 3 seconds
store text of ps_b2b_prp_1st_product as prp_1stProduct
click prp_best_price
wait until element b2b_assist_chat_login_link is visible
verify element b2b_assist_first_card contains "${prp_1stProduct}"
verify text "Log in to begin" on page
click close_button
wait 2 seconds
# --- Catalogue Send Enquiry -> old blue RFQ page ---
open https://www.justdial.com/Thane/Bhavani-Tiles-Oppposite-to-Deepak-Hospital-Mira-Road-East/022PXX22-XX22-120225035322-Q5G7_BZDET?catid=&checkin=&checkout=&vpfs=&stxt=%20Tile%20Wholesalers&nid=10482503&stype=category_list&search=Tile-Wholesalers&area=Oppposite%20To%20Deepak%20Hospital%20Mira%20Road%20East&type=Ceramic%20Tile%20Dealers&totalJdReviews=undefined&bdmsgtype=2&bdcaptiontype=4&bdpage=rsltpge&slectedDimgTag=&show_open_abd=0&isb2b=1&thumbnail_tag=
wait 3 seconds
verify element b2b_catalogue_send_enquiry_cta_top is visible
click b2b_catalogue_send_enquiry_cta_top
call SG_RFQ_Old_Form_Or_Blue_Page_Opened
delete all cookies
refresh page
# --- Services PRP (Bulk SMS) Get Best Price -> B2B Assist chat ---
# (was a "No results found!" page; it now lists sellers, so that check is dropped)
open https://www.justdial.com/jdmart/Mumbai/Bulk-SMS-Services/jdm-1156173-ent-14-10970459?fl=undefined&ismap=undefined&subpage=&searchCase=&term=bulk%2520sms&searchLocUpdate=0&stype=category_list&srcterm=Bulk%20SMS%20Services
wait 3 seconds
store text of ps_b2b_prp_1st_product as sms_1stProduct
click prp_best_price
wait until element b2b_assist_chat_login_link is visible
verify element b2b_assist_first_card contains "${sms_1stProduct}"
click close_button
wait 1 seconds
delete all cookies
refresh page
# --- Catalogue (Union Pumps) Send Enquiry -> blue RFQ page ---
open https://www.justdial.com/Mumbai/Union-Pumps-Company-Near-Bombay-Stock-Exchange-Fort/022PXX22-XX22-091217091909-E3F1_BZDET?trkid=&term=&ncatid=10531207&area=Marol%20Naka%20Andheri%20East&search=Popular%20Water%20Pump%20Dealers%20Crompton%20Greaves%20in%20Marol%20Naka%20Andheri%20East,%20Mumbai&mncatname=Water%20Pump%20Dealers-Crompton%20Greaves&ftterm=&csell=&oncatid=10531207&abd_btn=&abd_heading=&bd=1&cat_b2b_flag=1&searchfrom=lst&thumbnail=crompton-greaves-water-pump-27o6por
wait until element b2b_catalogue_send_enquiry_cta_top is visible
click b2b_catalogue_send_enquiry_cta_top
call SG_RFQ_Old_Form_Or_Blue_Page_Opened
# OFF: answering and submitting sends a real enquiry
delete all cookies
refresh page
wait 1 seconds
# --- Catalogue (Lixo Healthcare) Send Enquiry -> blue RFQ page ---
open https://www.justdial.com/Noida/Lixo-Healthcare-Equipment-Pvt-Ltd-Noida-Sector-38/011PXX11-XX11-180704154533-X1Y3_BZDET
wait until element b2b_catalogue_send_enquiry_cta_top is visible
